  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Pack Mentality" id="7ec2-95a2-9ab0-7d81" hidden="false">
      <description>When making Fallback checks, Ratkin models may add a +1 modifer to their roll for each other friendly non-Grunt Ratkin model within 6”, that have not also already failed their own Fallback check this Round. A natural roll of 1 will still fail the test as normal.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Screech Song" id="f279-d28b-c9e1-bec7" hidden="false">
      <description>Enemy models within 6” of one or more friendly models with this rule suffer a -1 modifier to their Armour rolls.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Endless Swarm" id="2059-5d2b-8150-921f" hidden="false">
      <description>During deployment, the Ratkin player may place three 25mm Nest Entrance tokens on the board (place all 3 at the same time, counting as one model deployment). These cannot be within 6” of an objective or another Nest Entrance token, or in the enemy deployment area. Nest Entrance tokens count as Impassable Height 0 terrain. 
When a friendly Ratkin GRUNT is removed from play, roll a D8. On a 5+ the GRUNT can be placed adjacent to any friendly Nest Entrance tokens. It may not be placed in base contact with an enemy model. If there is no room to place the GRUNT, it is removed from play as normal. The returned model is marked as Activated and Fatigued, and as they have returned they are counted as remaining models for checking if the Warband is broken. 
A Nest Entrance can be destroyed - an enemy model must be in base contact with the Nest Entrance token and use a long action to remove it. In scenarios which score for killed models, GRUNTS killed score as normal, even if they return via a Nest Entrance.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Eye of the Abyss" id="8ee9-879e-720e-ae99" hidden="false">
      <description>Declare you are using this ability in the Roll for Power phase. Twitch does not generate any Power Dice this Round. Instead, in the next Roll for Power phase Twitch will generate an additional White Power Dice.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Will of the Brood" id="84f4-e1f2-4549-493c" hidden="false">
      <description>If this model starts the Round within 6” of the Birthing Daughter, upgrade one of its Power Dice from Red to White.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Inspire Fear" id="97c9-9bf4-ca36-b492" hidden="false">
      <description>When within 3” of this model, friendly GRUNTS and WARRIORS gain the Bloodlust ability.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
